'''The Den of Flame''' is an area in [[Dustwallow Marsh]], just west of the [[Stonemaul Ruins]] that has been completely overrun by [[dragonkin]] of the [[Black Dragonflight]], presumably under the orders of the great [[Black Dragon]], [[Onyxia]] who resides nearby. The architecture in the area suggests that the structure may have been built by the [[Stonemaul]] [[ogres]].

